<section class="section section--pad" aria-labelledby="fleet-priorities-heading">
  <div class="panel panel--soft">
    <div class="trg-editable" data-trg-editable>
      <div class="trg-editable__fallback">
        <h2 id="fleet-priorities-heading" class="heading-lg">Your Fleet Priorities</h2>
        <div class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="body-md">Bring your assets, planning questions and available information into one focused discussion. Support for organizations across the U.S. and Canada.</p>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment Evaluations</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Review vehicle and equipment assets to support replacement and budget planning. Identify the assets that require attention and the decisions ahead.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Replacement Planning</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Consider replacement priorities in relation to your existing fleet and planning timeframe. Discuss upcoming needs and the information available to guide them.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Fleet Utilization</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Examine how vehicles and equipment are used across your operation. Explore utilization questions alongside the needs of your airport or municipality.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Equipment Specifications</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Discuss specifications for vehicles and equipment in the context of your operating requirements. Identify where experienced input is needed.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Total Cost of Ownership</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Review ownership-cost information as part of fleet planning. Bring the cost questions and available records relevant to your equipment decisions.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="info-card">
            <h3 class="heading-sm">Planning &amp; Budgeting</h3>
            <p class="body-sm">Support fleet department planning and replacement budgeting. Define the priorities and resource limitations that should shape the scope of assistance.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trg-editable__cms">
        <squarespace:block-field id="fleetManagementServicesPriorities" columns="12" label="EDIT: Your Fleet Priorities" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

